Subject: [PATCH] feat(capture): gnostral_prefill_check, decode-path versus
 prefill-path self-consistency

For every prompt of a capture and every step i < K, one full prefill of the
chat-templated prompt plus the first i captured tokens gives the
distribution of token i; a correct engine predicts the same token as the
incremental decode that produced the capture. Raw-logits CompletionTokens
requests with max_len 1 (the engine refuses 0).

